  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://blay09.net/files/brand/gravelminer.png\" alt=\"礫石採集者\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\"></p><p style=\"display:flex\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/requires-balm.png\" alt=\"需要Balm模組\" width=\"260\" height=\"80\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmods.twelveiterations.com%252fsponsor\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"margin-left:26px\" src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/new-patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon贊助支持\" width=\"550\" height=\"80\"></a></p><p>這個模組能解決玩家在挖礦時常遇到的礫石塌落問題，讓您的採礦之旅更加愉快。</p><p>當您破壞方塊時，上方的掉落礫石會立即被破壞。</p><p>本模組支援NeoForge、Fabric和Forge平台，需搭配<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Balm</a>模組共同安裝使用。</p><h3><img src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/features-header.png\" alt=\"功能特色\" width=\"836\" height=\"40\"></h3><ul>\n<li>破壞下方方塊時自動瞬碎掉落礫石</li>\n<li>客戶端可選安裝，僅需在需要使用的設備上安裝</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/35/764/gravelminerserver.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"470\"></p>",
